<title>GERMANY: Fresenius says 96 profit up 45 pct.</title>
<headline>Fresenius says 96 profit up 45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BAD HOMBURG, Germany 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   132     up 45 pct</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (DVFA method)     7.05    vs 5.17 marks</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,635   up 63 pct</p>
<p>    Dividend common share		    1.80    vs 1.50 marks</p>
<p>    Dividend preference share		1.90    vs 1.60 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German medical group is Fresenius AG. On Monday the group announced it planned to raise capital to fund further acquisitions.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
